        "rank": 2,
        "evidence_text": "The regular oil filler cap is replaced by the oil filler cap incl. SOBEK quick-release cap. Purchase via Porsche Motorsport parts catalogue.\n\nEngine switched off.\n\nMaximum pressure 2 bar.\n\nFill the engine oil in 200 ml steps.\n\nFor quick filling, the pressure bottle \"Oilstick Magnum F2K Dispenser\" from the manufac -turer SOBEK is recommended.\n\nPurchase and further information via SOBEK Motorsporttechnik GmbH & Co. KG . For contact, see page 1009 .",
