        "rank": 9,
        "evidence_text": "Syntax\n\n2 * ([Air box pressure] - [static pressure])/(GLOBALCONST(Air Density) * pow([Speed],2)\n\nChannels\n\nAir box Pressure, Static Pressure, Speed\n\nDefinition\n\nAir box efficiency is the ratio of the pressure in the air box to the maximum available pressure. The maximum available pressure is the pressure of a free stream flow due to the speed of the car.",
