        "rank": 14,
        "evidence_text": "Incorrectly adjusted camber and tyre pressure values can cause tyre failure.\n\nRespect the specified camber and tyre pressure values listed in the Michelin Precos (Porsche Technical recommendations N3_N3R_2025.pdf)).\n\nFor circuits not listed in the Michelin Precos, the specifications for 'low stress circuit standard' must be used.\n\nExceeding the maximum camber shim thickness for the corresponding circuit type is not permitted.",
